  "verseCount": 34,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "21",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GEN 21"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "21",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sala àmmelekela mwana Iblahimu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yahwe nkum'baliki Sala kwa kuntendela muchi chanamwahidite. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahi Sala nkwikuta chitumbo, nkummalekela Iblahimu mwana wachilume akuno Iblahimu avèlè nsele namene. Na anelo láhumidile mmahiku ulala lanahawile Nnungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwana ayula, Sala wammelekedile Iblahimu, Iblahimu nkunchema lina Isaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaka panavele na changa cha maduva nane, Iblahimu nkunnyalula malinga chanalaijijwe nawi Nnungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pavelekwejije Isaka, Iblahimu ávele na vyaka myamoja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahi Sala nkuchidoni, “Nnungu àngutendile nguheke, na munu woheyo ambepilikâna habali adino, àmbelihekela chalumo na nangu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dachi, nnani achichiahulule kunnyaulila Iblahimu kuva, nangu Sala nguchinguyong'eje vavana? Tena nìmmelekedile mwana wachilume muusele wake!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaka nkuhweneha kukulumuka, na liduva alila livanannekehije kuyong'a, Iblahimu nkuntendela Isaka ing'ole ing'ulungwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kuvingangwa kwa Isumaili na Hajili",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Liduva limo Sala ámmwene Isumaili, mwana wanga Iblahimu wammelekedile Hajili, nkongwe wa ku Misili, wannembula Isaka mwanawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahi Sala nkunnyaulila Iblahimu kuchidoni, “Mmingange ayu ntumwa chalumo na mwanawe, kwa kuva ikáhululika mwana wanga ntumwa kupata mapala pamo na mwanangu Isaka.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chinu anecho chíninnyundaja namene Iblahimu, kwa kuva Isumaili nanang'e nni mwanawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Henga Nnungu nkunnyaulila Iblahimu kuchidoni, “Unayundale ing'anya ya aneyo mwana, wala aneyo ntumwa wako. Chinu chohecho chambekuhaulila Sala wako chitende, kwa kuva, vanu va nnukolo lwako vàmbehalokana na Isaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na kwamba aneyo mwana wanga ntumwa wako, nanang'e nìmbentenda kuva atata wa chilambo chikulungwa, kwa kuva, nanang'e nni mwanalo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahi ulyamba namambumbu, Iblahimu nkutwala chakulya na medi, nkunnyakuja Hajili mmavala, nkumminganga chalumo na mwanawe. Hajili nkuuka, nkuva wadumba-dumba nnilanga lya ku Beli-sheba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Àlalá medi palannyilidile, Hajili nkunnaja mwanawe pachihole. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anepo Hajili nkuhwena kunyenje kadiki, malinga mita myamoja uvila, walitangolela chimunda-munda kuchidoni, “Nikátamwa nimwone mwanangu pámbekùvà wahwa.” Hajili panaikele anepo, nkukuta kwa uchungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nnungu nkumpilikana mwana wakuta, malaika wanga Nnungu nkunchema Hajili kuhaloka kulihunde nkunnyaulila kuchidoni, “Chikutendile chani Hajili? Bahi unayope, ing'anya Nnungu ànipilikana chitangelo chake kuhaloka apala pávèlè. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imila uhwene ukampembeje mwana kwa kuva, nìmbentenda kuva chilambo chikulungwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahi Nnungu nkunkusumbula Hajili meho, nkuchona chihima cha medi. Nang'e nkuhwena unateka medi, nkunankumbija mwanawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahi Nnungu nkunchunga ayula mwana, na aneyo mwana nkuhweneha kukulumuka. Nkuikala kulilanga, na nkuva munu amaîte kutemelela saana upinde. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwana aneyo áikala kulilanga lya Palani, na anyokwe nkunnembelela mmahe kuhaloka nchilambo cha ku Misili.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lilailano lya Iblahimu na Nfalume Abimeleki",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahi mmahiku ulolo, Nfalume Abimeleki pamo na Fikoli, nkulungwa wa matiyala lake, nkummwenela Iblahimu, nkunnyaulila kuchidoni, “Nnungu àvele pamo na wako kwa kila chinu chiutenda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahi ngwapilile kwa lina lya Nnungu kuva nanga paumbengulambila nangu wala vana vangu wala vanu va nnukolo lwangu. Malinga chinikutendedile nangu lambone, na wako uchocho ngutendele nangu lambone chalumo na vanu va chilambo achino chuwikala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iblahimu nkuchidoni, “Mbènkwapila kuva nguchingutende uchocho.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mmahiku anelo Iblahimu nkunhinginikila Abimeleki kwamba chihima cha medi chivanampakanywele vatumwa vanga Abimeleki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Henga Abimeleki nkunnyaulila Iblahimu kuchidoni, “Nangu nikánkameke atendîle uchocho, na nanga paunanguhaulidile. Nangu nelo njo kupilikana habali anedyo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahi Iblahimu nkutwala dingandolo na dimbudi na ding'ombe, nkumwing'a Abimeleki, vammalele vavili nkutenda lilailano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iblahimu nkudihapula dingandolo saba dya chimahe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abimeleki nkummuja Iblahimu kuchidoni, “Ing'anya ntwani ùvahapula anevo angandolo saba va chimahe?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iblahimu nkunnyang'ula kuchidoni, “Avano angandolo saba vachimahe ngùyuwa uvapwechelele kuhaloka kwang'une, uchinga ùùve ushahidi kuva nangu njo nguhimbîle chihima achino.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahi apala pachinu nkupachema Beli-sheba,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21:31",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Lilove “Beli-sheba,” kwa Chieblaniya lìnahululika kuva na mana dimbili, yani “chihima cha kwapila” au “chihima cha saba,” ing'anya ya adila dingandolo saba.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kwa kuva vammalele vavili vániapilanila pachinu anepo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bada ya kutenda lilailano anelyo aneko ku Beli-sheba, Abimeleki na Fikoli, nkulu wa matiyala lake nkuuyang'ana kwavo, chilambo cha Vafilisti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iblahimu nkupanda nnandi wa nkwaju akula ku Beli-sheba, nkunnyuwa Yahwe, Nnungu wa vyaka na vyaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahi Iblahimu nkuikala nchilambo cha Vafilisti kwa vyaka vyohe malinga mmidi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
